  "note": "Germany surfaces the clock half of the same arc: it starts where the invoice is raised and follows the money out. It shares invoice, clock and reconcile with the other layers and adds register, deadlines, watch and escalate, which is what a spine covering the whole arc is for. The 21-day interim window under paragraph 16 VOB/B is a slot value, not a different sentence.",
